### Excluded for depending on paid hosted APIs

This corpus covers open-source and local-hostable tools only. Content whose
subject is a paid, hosted AI generation service is excluded, because using it
requires an account and a per-call fee, and the local alternatives live in
other skills in this repository instead.

| Entry | Reason |
|---|---|
| `fal-ai-media` | Documents fal.ai's hosted generation endpoints (Veo, Kling, Seedance, Nano Banana) and ElevenLabs — paid hosted services. See `local-diffusion-suite`, `local-tts-engines`, and `music-generation` for the local equivalents. |

Where a skill merely mentioned a hosted service in one example alongside
otherwise-local guidance, the example was rewritten to use a local tool rather
than excluding the whole skill.

